From: PhoneKit
Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: restore hci_sock.c (vendor copy had sections commented out)

The vendor tree carries net/bluetooth/hci_sock.c with the cookie, monitor and ioctl code
commented out (Samsung uses its own userspace Bluetooth stack), which does not compile
with CONFIG_BT=y. This restores the file from Android common kernel android-4.14-stable.

diff --git a/net/bluetooth/hci_sock.c b/net/bluetooth/hci_sock.c
index d23ee41be..b67fc4c44 100644
--- a/net/bluetooth/hci_sock.c
+++ b/net/bluetooth/hci_sock.c
